{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t警方聯同內地公安搗破一個針對到深圳消費港人的跨境信用卡詐騙集團，共拘捕33人。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方表示，犯罪集團成員包括內地扒手及娛樂場所的內應，在內地盜取港人信用卡後會安排成員來港刷卡購物，約60宗案件共涉款約180萬元。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:54:39.841265+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T11:37:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T16:58:29.512984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:26.244630+00:00","content_hash":"27702742ab89357de58d6115fa3c641ca17b8263a7047f2472d4a992a5ff64a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}